s is used to counter the negative aspects of the theories, making C the correct option.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: C\n\nThe statement about therapeutic success is used to override considerations against the theories, as it highlights their effectiveness despite their lack of elegance and explanatory power.\n\nThe correct option is: C",
