ion C is about methodology, which isn't the primary point here.\n\nTherefore, the author is mainly explaining how height data serves as a reflection of past conditions, making option D the correct choice.\n</think>\n\nThe author explains that height data can be used to reflect past socio-economic conditions, particularly through the study of economic history. This is best captured by option D.\n\nThe correct option is: D",
