irectly mentions the effect on social life, which is a key point.\n\nWait, the passage starts by talking about China's overall innovation capability enhancing and its impact on development, then moves to the epidemic's effect. The title should reflect the broader impact of innovation. So, B might be better because it's about the innovation-driven approach bringing about a new world in science and technology, which is a central theme. Option C is more about the effect on social life, which is a specific aspect.\n\nI think B is the most suitable because it encapsulates the transformative power of innovation in driving changes across various fields, which aligns with the passage's main points.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: B) Innovation-driven brings a new world of science and technology",
