ecause it's aiming for a social result.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: C\n\nThe purpose of a crime is the specific direction of the criminal motive, aiming for a social result. Option C describes a purpose to consolidate friendship, which is a social outcome, aligning with the definition.\n\nThe correct option is: C",
