use it connects the training to reducing the most expensive repairs, thereby making the repair cost drop more than the number of collisions.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: C\n\nThe additional training will focus on helping ground crews avoid those kinds of ground collisions that cause the most costly damage, which explains why repair costs will drop more than the number of collisions.",
