t. It's more about the process and the book's role rather than the creator's requirements.\n\nSo, the main content is about the process of mutual accommodation between language and emotion in poetry creation, which is option B.\n</think>\n\nThe main content of the text is that poetry creation is a process of mutual accommodation between language and emotion. \n\nThe correct option is: B",
