e same scale. The other options either don't tie directly to the given reason or are more about broader trends or other factors.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A\n\nThe reasoning is that Option A directly supports the statement by showing that companies with more international business have higher profits compared to those with less, thus explaining why Shell, with extensive international operations, ranks first.\n\nThe correct option is: A",
