y can obtain scarce information quickly, especially the positive side. This suggests they use a lot of information resources, but it's about having access to them rather than occupying them. So I'm not sure if this is the best fit.\n\nPutting it all together, Option C seems to best capture the idea that Pancake people are keen to cover a wide range of topics but don't necessarily require detailed explanations. They have a broad knowledge base but aren't deep thinkers or require extensive explanations.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: C",
