s disagreeing with the manager's assessment of running costs because the new equipment is more efficient than previously thought.\n\nSo the point of disagreement is about the fuel efficiency of the closed furnaces, which affects the running costs. Therefore, the correct answer should be D.\n</think>\n\nThe supervisor disagrees with the plant manager's point about the fuel efficiency of the new closed furnaces, which affects the running costs of the new process.\n\nThe correct option is: D",
