      "text": "<think>\nOkay, so I need to figure out which of the options A, B, C, or D is a rebuttal to the given statement. The context says that people can be divided into those who are a little ambitious and those who aren't. Ambition is important for pulling people out of ordinary lives, making them powerful and informed, and during times of change, it can lead to great results. So the main idea is that ambition is a positive trait that helps people achieve a lot.\n\nNow, the question is asking which statement contradicts or rebutts this idea. A rebuttal would show that even with ambition, something negative can happen, or that without ambition, people can still achieve great things, or maybe that ambition isn't always good.\n\nLooking at the options:\n\nOption A: Liu bei started with no ambition but became successful. Wait, no, the context says a little ambition is good. So if Liu bei didn't have ambition, he wouldn't have succeeded. But the option says he didn't have ambition but went from empty-handed to successful. That seems to contradict the idea because it shows that without ambition, you can still achieve a lot. So this might be a rebuttal.\n\nOption B: Zhang xiong had high ambitions but was mediocre in intelligence. He worked hard but didn't achieve anything. This supports the idea because it shows that even with ambition, if you lack intelligence, you might not succeed. So this doesn't rebut the statement; it aligns with it.\n\nOption C: Liu qin lacks ambition and talent but succeeded because of her beauty and help from others. This supports the idea because it shows that without ambition and talent, you can still achieve things through other means. So this doesn't rebut the original statement.\n\nOption D: The chrysanthemum sister isn't talented or beautiful but thinks highly of herself and leads a prosperous life. This also supports the idea because it shows that without natural talent or beauty, someone can still succeed through self-worship and other personal traits. So this doesn't rebut the statement.\n\nSo the only option that seems to contradict the original idea is Option A because it shows that without ambition, you can still achieve a lot, which goes against the statement that a little ambition is necessary for success.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A\n\nThe reasoning is that Option A presents a scenario where a lack of ambition leads to significant success, directly contradicting the original statement that a little ambition is crucial for achieving success. \n\nThe correct option is: A",
